{"id":"question.starryos.cgroup.delegation.checkpoint.2","unit_ids":["unit.starryos.cgroup.delegation"],"node_ids":["kc.os.cgroup.hierarchy-semantics"],"source_refs":["src.linux.cgroup-v2-doc"],"pool":"checkpoint","type":"code","prompt":"设计 no-internal-process 规则的正负测试时应包含什么？","options":[],"answer":"建立父子层级、在父节点存在成员与无成员两种状态下启用域控制器，断言允许/拒绝及错误，并检查失败后 subtree_control 与成员关系不变。","explanation":"负例必须验证失败后的状态不变量。","difficulty":4,"status":"candidate","generated_by":{"tool":"@os-camp/ptkg","version":"0.4.0","agent":"g5-golden-course"},"content_hash":""}
