{"id":"question.starryos.cgroup.cpu.checkpoint.1","unit_ids":["unit.starryos.cgroup.cpu"],"node_ids":["outcome.starryos.cgroup.controller-framework","project.starryos.cgroup"],"source_refs":["src.axcgroup.cpu-rs","src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"pool":"checkpoint","type":"design","prompt":"如何区分 cpu 属性可写、记账变化和调度限速生效？","options":[],"answer":"分别验证属性解析/回读、内部状态/统计更新，以及相同负载在不同 cgroup 限额下的实际 CPU 时间差异，并用未接 hook 故障版本做对照。","explanation":"三层证据防止把接口外观当作 enforcement。","difficulty":4,"status":"candidate","generated_by":{"tool":"@os-camp/ptkg","version":"0.4.0","agent":"g5-golden-course"},"content_hash":""}
{"id":"question.starryos.cgroup.cpu.checkpoint.2","unit_ids":["unit.starryos.cgroup.cpu"],"node_ids":["project.starryos.cgroup"],"source_refs":["src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"pool":"checkpoint","type":"code","prompt":"设计 cpu controller 对照负载时必须控制哪些变量？","options":[],"answer":"固定 QEMU vCPU、相同工作量和运行时长、仅改变 cgroup cpu 配置，重复测量 CPU 时间/完成量，并设置无控制组基线和超时。","explanation":"可比较负载才能把差异归因于控制器。","difficulty":3,"status":"candidate","generated_by":{"tool":"@os-camp/ptkg","version":"0.4.0","agent":"g5-golden-course"},"content_hash":""}
