{"id":"question.starryos.cgroup.memory.checkpoint.1","unit_ids":["unit.starryos.cgroup.memory"],"node_ids":["outcome.starryos.cgroup.controller-framework","project.starryos.cgroup"],"source_refs":["src.axcgroup.memory-rs","src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"pool":"checkpoint","type":"design","prompt":"memory 超限测试为什么还必须包含释放后恢复？","options":[],"answer":"仅看超限拒绝无法发现 uncharge 泄漏；释放后重新分配应恢复可用额度，并保持计数不负、不重复归还。","explanation":"资源回收是 memory 生命周期正确性的必要部分。","difficulty":3,"status":"candidate","generated_by":{"tool":"@os-camp/ptkg","version":"0.4.0","agent":"g5-golden-course"},"content_hash":""}
{"id":"question.starryos.cgroup.memory.checkpoint.2","unit_ids":["unit.starryos.cgroup.memory"],"node_ids":["project.starryos.cgroup"],"source_refs":["src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"pool":"checkpoint","type":"code","prompt":"如何用故障注入区分只更新统计和真实拒绝超限分配？","options":[],"answer":"设置很小限额并持续分配，正常版本应在边界失败；故障版本绕过分配前 check 但保留统计，若测试仍通过则判别力不足。","explanation":"seeded fault 检查测试是否覆盖 enforcement 而非表面计数。","difficulty":4,"status":"candidate","generated_by":{"tool":"@os-camp/ptkg","version":"0.4.0","agent":"g5-golden-course"},"content_hash":""}
